<title>HONG KONG: Burwill half-year profit down 58.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Burwill half-year profit down 58.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   3.3	 vs 8.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.3	 vs 4.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  6.76 gain vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    25.03     vs 60.23</p>
<p>    Turnover		     553.05    vs 540.15</p>
<p>    Company name		 Burwill Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  April 14-22</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   May 2</p>
<p>NOTE - Burwill Holdings is a metals proccessing and investment firm.</p>
<p>The exceptional item represents a claim received for stock loss in a ship accident in the prior year.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
